{
 "id": "05fc4cfc-a568-4a6d-ac31-ca5adf5a4f5d",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I Became the Mother of the Sub-Male Lead's Son"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "서브남주 아들의 엄마가 되었습니다"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Became the Mother of the Supporting Male Lead's Son"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Reincarnated as Elia, the daughter of a ruined noble, the protagonist struggles to escape debt collectors. One day, she saves a child from an attack, only to be mistaken for a kidnapper and taken to Duke Kaiden’s mansion. To avoid punishment, she becomes the child’s nanny. Now, she must clear the misunderstanding and find a way to survive in her new life.\n\n---\nThe protagonist is reincarnated as 'Elia', a noblewoman and a failed novelist who is an extra character in a romance fantasy novel. Despite being chased by creditors, she saves a child from being beaten by a thug, but is framed as a kidnapper and dragged to the Duke 'Kaiden's' mansion.\n \n\"Do you know? If you live like that forever, everyone will leave you.\"\n\nElia, who speaks her mind, becomes a nanny instead of being punished. Will Elia be able to clear her misunderstanding?",
   "ko": "로판 소설 속 엑스트라이자 쫄딱 망한 자작가의 영애, '엘리아'에 빙의한 주인공.\n빚쟁이들에게 쫓기는 신세임이도 불구하고 괴한에게 구타당하는 아이를 구해주지만, 유괴범으로 몰려 공작 '카이든'의 저택으로 끌려가게 된다.\n\n'그거 아세요? 평생 그렇게 살다가는 전부 떠나가고 말 거라는걸'\n할 말은 하는 성격 덕에 처벌 대신 보모 생활을 하게 된 엘리아. 과연 엘리아는 무사히 오해를 풀 수 있을까?"
  },
